[en.DECISION_C01_C08_CLOSE_BORDER]
Reinforce Border

[en.DECISION_C01_C08_CLOSE_BORDER_desc]
So many ponies have joined Starlight because... our border patrol forces have a massive hole in them.

No! These idiots can’t even manage a few borders!!! The empress must go down and show the Ministry of Defense’s trash how I, the Friendship Empress manages the borders!

[zh.DECISION_C01_C08_CLOSE_BORDER]
边境补防

[zh.DECISION_C01_C08_CLOSE_BORDER_desc]
能有这么多小马加入星光熠熠，是因为...我们的边境守卫力量出了大漏洞。

不！这群饭桶，连几条边境都管不了！！！女皇必须亲自下场，让国防部的废物看看我，友谊女皇是怎么管理边境的！
